        <example>
          <unicode>ᠨᠢᠭᠣᠷ ᠡᠪᠳᠡᠷᠡᠺᠦ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- ebdereky</transcript>
          <definition> To break up ( v.i., of a friendship)</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠨᠢᠭᠣᠷ ᠮᠠᠭᠤᠲᠠᠢ</unicode>
